MODULE: PermitConservationReleaseKeepsOwnership
TARGET: PermitConservation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: completed work returns capacity but still claims to hold it
PERTURBS: Release

--- FIND
Release(r) == OwnerComplete(r) /\ r \notin hung /\ Return(r, "done") /\ UNCHANGED opportunity
--- REPLACE
Release(r) == OwnerComplete(r) /\ r \notin hung /\ Return(r, "holding") /\ UNCHANGED opportunity
--- END
